

# <type>(<optional scope>): <description>
#
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, test, docs, chore, build, ci
# Scope: the affected part, e.g. s7, mqtt, buffer, gateway
# Add "!" before ":" for a breaking change, e.g. "refactor!: ..."
#
# Leave a blank line after the subject, then explain why the change is needed.
#
# Example: feat(s7): read multiple PLCs in parallel
